---
description: Next.js App Router patterns for *-web apps (Server Components, routes, actions)
globs:
  - 'apps/*-web/src/app/**/*.tsx'
  - 'apps/*-web/src/app/**/*.ts'
alwaysApply: false
---

# Next.js App Router (*-web only)

- Default to Server Components; add `'use client'` only for hooks, browser APIs, or interactivity
- Fetch in Server Components when possible; use React Query for client fetching
- Route files: `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`; API routes in `app/api/*/route.ts`
- API routes / Server Actions: validate with Zod, consistent error responses, auth in middleware or handlers
- Do not apply these patterns to Expo Router apps (`apps/*-app`)
